      "source_location": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": null,
      "author": null,
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "The Spec Kit is a feature specification workflow system: specify → clarify → plan → tasks → analyze → implement, with supporting commands for constitution, checklist, agent-context-update, and tasks-to-issues. The workflow is gated by constitution compliance and checklist validation."
    },
    {
      "id": "_agents_skills_speckit_analyze_SKILL_extension_hooks",
      "label": "Extension Hooks Pattern",
      "file_type": "concept",
      "source_file": "C:\\AI\\ParkingUSA\\.agents\\skills\\speckit-analyze\\SKILL.md",
      "source_location": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": null,
      "author": null,
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "Every speckit SKILL.md command implements the same extension hooks pattern: before_* / after_* hooks from .specify/extensions.yml. The hook system supports optional and mandatory hooks with dot-to-hyphen command name conversion and condition-skipping logic."
    },
    {
      "id": "_agents_skills_speckit_constitution_SKILL_project_constitution",
